# Case Knowledge pipeline (Phase 4D-1) — the pipeline TOOLING is tracked
# (internal/*.py, internal/*.md, internal/*.schema.json, internal/fixtures/),
# but candidate / source / review PAYLOAD is unverified working material and
# must never be served as a public asset, so it stays untracked. See
# internal/README.md ("Git policy — Option A").
/internal/candidates/*
!/internal/candidates/.gitkeep
/internal/sources/*
!/internal/sources/.gitkeep
/internal/review/*
!/internal/review/.gitkeep
